a\nSELECT \n  s.item_id,\n  s.birth_year,\n  s.total_sales,\n  (s.total_sales / (SELECT AVG(total_sales) FROM sales_agg)) AS sales_ratio\nFROM \n  sales_agg s\nWHERE \n  s.birth_year BETWEEN 1987 AND 1993;\n```\n\nPlease note that this rewritten query is an attempt to simplify the original query and may not exactly match the original query's behavior. The actual performance of the rewritten query will depend on the specific database management system being used, as well as the size and complexity of the underlying data.", 'time': 19.09994149208069}
